{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Ooble Gardens, a cozy world where you play as an Ooble gardener, tending to a giant garden pot in a quiet backyard. Care for the playful Oobles by crafting their dream fairy garden. Using the offerings they give you, merge and combine to discover an endless variety of cozy furniture to decorate the garden with!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a giant <strong>garden pot</strong> in a backyard, decorate this empty pot to transform it into a warm and whimsical fairy garden for little Oobles to live and play in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/9840858311f949946f00353f4260bf0a.poster.avif?t=1756082002\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/9840858311f949946f00353f4260bf0a.webm?t=1756082002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/9840858311f949946f00353f4260bf0a.mp4?t=1756082002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oobles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Oobles</strong>, whimsical and playful spirits of nature that reside in the garden pot, dreaming visions of their ideal fairy garden that you can help create! Accept their offerings that can range from flowers to even mushrooms to decorate and build the garden with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/a06b5b436d9d8558d09f0ef3c4d73f46.poster.avif?t=1756082002\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/a06b5b436d9d8558d09f0ef3c4d73f46.webm?t=1756082002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/a06b5b436d9d8558d09f0ef3c4d73f46.mp4?t=1756082002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine, Discover, Repeat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the offerings that Oobles give you, <strong>merge and combine</strong> them to discover countless cozy furniture options to\u00a0decorate and create a whimsical fairy garden! As you discover new combinations, it'll add to your journal. Experiment with different combinations to discover and complete your journal!\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/bb5dbd8365c41862fe2d86602ec772b2.poster.avif?t=1756082002\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/bb5dbd8365c41862fe2d86602ec772b2.webm?t=1756082002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/bb5dbd8365c41862fe2d86602ec772b2.mp4?t=1756082002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949790?t=1756082002","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949790?t=1756082002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/c746b5092fa14378c32dc4e5c3d7e8b9d942a444/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756082002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/c746b5092fa14378c32dc4e5c3d7e8b9d942a444/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756082002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without